Z||000001||Dave Gunsul||05-04-2001||10:29 PM||||I would advise you to buy an ADS chip instead. The Hypertech chips don't seem to do<BR>much of anything. People that i've talked to that have the Hyper-chips don't like them either. My ADS chip made a notable difference.<P>BTW stick shift cars don't experience as much of a gain from a chip as an auto does because the chip also changes the autos shift pattern. (holds gears longer)<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
